  "definition": "Tree Care Operations",
  "effectiveDate": "2025-11-22",
  "expirationDate": "2035-11-22",
  "historyNote": "#4118 eff 8-22-86, EXPIRED: 8-22-92 New. #6684, eff 2-4-98, EXPIRED: 2-4-06 New. #8606, INTERIM, eff 4-12-06, EXPIRED: 10-09-06 (formerly Lab 1403.80) New. #8796, eff 1-11-07 (formerly Lab 1403.67); ss by #10809, eff 4-9-15 (from Lab 1403.60); ss by #14431, eff 11-22-25, EXPIRES: 11-22-35",
